"description":"Welcome to Panda Bamboo Fable! Step into the role of a caring companion in a bamboo zoo, and begin a heartwarming journey alongside adorable pandas. Here, you can look after these cute creatures and nurture a lively, cozy panda habitat.\nCare for Panda Friends, Build a Charming Home​\nAs the gentle keeper of this bamboo sanctuary, you'll meet pandas of all kinds. Through attentive care and interaction, your pandas will bring you little surprises, helping you gradually build a more wonderful home together.\nMeet More Pandas, Unlock Warm Surprises​\nMerge two adorable pandas to call forth an even rarer and more lively companion! Every encounter and merge is a heartwarming moment. Collect pandas with different looks, watch them grow, and create your own unique panda paradise.\nFresh Hand-Drawn Style, Immerse in a Soothing World​\nThe game features soft, bright colors and delicate cartoon art, creating a vivid and serene bamboo landscape. Accompanied by light, pleasant natural soundscapes, you'll feel truly immersed in a green, playful, and soothing panda world.\nPanda Bamboo Fable— It's a warm and gentle experience of companionship and tending, with no rush—just the simple joy of caring and collecting. Come meet your first panda and start building your dream bamboo home today!", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.45821000000000022822632672614417970180511474609375, "bundleId":"com.cases.asked.brands", "sellerUrl":"https://modoiso.com", "languageCodesISO2A":["EN", "ZH"], "fileSizeBytes":"154843136", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":347, "trackContentRating":"12+", "trackCensoredName":"Panda Bamboo Fable", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/panda-bamboo-fable/id6767114083?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"12+", "averageUserRating":4.45821000000000022822632672614417970180511474609375, "genres":["Games"], "userRatingCount":347}, 
